.TH batten-release-cut 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-cut \- Discard any draft of the version, draft it at the release head and dispatch its build
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release cut\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-sha\fR> <\fB\-\-changelog\fR> <\fB\-\-workflow\fR> <\fItag\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Discard any draft of the version, draft it at the release head and dispatch its build
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sha\fR \fI<sha>\fR
The commit the build was dispatched with
.TP
\fB\-\-changelog\fR \fI<changelog>\fR
The changelog carrying the release\*(Aqs `## [X]` section
.TP
\fB\-\-workflow\fR \fI<workflow>\fR
The workflow\*(Aqs file name, as the forge\*(Aqs workflow API names it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItag\fR>
The release\*(Aqs tag
